  "content": "Hūṃ!In the northwest of the land of Oḍḍiyāna,Upon the stem and filaments of a lotus,You attained the supreme, wondrous siddhi,Renowned as the Lotus-Born.Surrounded by a vast retinue of ḍākinīs,I shall practice, following in your footsteps;Please come in order to bestow your blessings.Guru Padma Siddhi Hūṃ",
